WEBVTT

00:05:28.513 --> 00:05:30.756
I didn't stand still long enough to do so.

00:05:32.102 --> 00:05:34.159
Whether it be via distraction,

00:05:34.183 --> 00:05:35.659
substance use,

00:05:35.683 --> 00:05:37.301
thrill-seeking

00:05:37.325 --> 00:05:40.674
or the scrupulous policing
of my inner speak,

00:05:40.698 --> 00:05:42.967
I refused to be static and silent.

00:05:44.927 --> 00:05:46.387
And with this noise,

00:05:46.411 --> 00:05:49.380
I also drew heavily
upon other parts of my life

00:05:49.404 --> 00:05:51.575
to construct a picture of who I was.

00:05:52.636 --> 00:05:53.866
I was a surfer,

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.607
a social science student,

00:05:55.631 --> 00:05:57.717
a friend to good people,

00:05:57.741 --> 00:05:59.999
a loved brother and son,